WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:09.730
<i>The countless flowers,
enveloped in light…</i>

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:20.500
<i>…gaze at tomorrow
with unwavering eyes.</i>

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:39.350
<i>Everyone wishes for me to be pure…</i>

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:46.810
<i>…but what can I bring
with me to the frayed skies?</i>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:53.900
<i>What I’ve made my own
by breaking off flowers in bloom…</i>

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:59.490
<i>All such sinful things…</i>

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:06.930
<i>Why did I stop making
promises with the future?</i>

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:14.240
<i>Because even if I try
to run far from all the pain…</i>

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:20.940
<i>…a cold wind rustles
my hair… Don’t you see?</i>

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:28.170
<i>Where can I ever find the answer?</i>

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:46.750
Bell Ri Majon!

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.170
Let’s go, Kaim!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.260
Right, Para-sama.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.650
Rimone! You’re going off course!

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:18.650
They failed.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:22.660
We failed again?

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:23.740
I won’t let them get away!

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.460
You did it!

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:44.970
Those two have been weird since
that day. Did something happen…

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:51.370
That was so Rimone’s fault.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:54.440
And after they let her in
for being some genius.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.480
Floe…

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.490
This isn’t fair to Aer.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:16.500
<b>White Loneliness</b>

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:28.770
Chor Tempest may be back on
active duty, but in that condition…

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:32.020
That’s Chor Tempest’s current state.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:37.570
Can you give us your perspective
as Chor Dextra’s sole survivor?

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:42.750
Granted, we’re not in
a position to be optimistic.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:47.580
It’s quite clear that this isn’t the same
unit known as the “elite” chor.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:51.530
At their current strength,
the afternoon shift is their best.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:54.760
It seems they can’t
return to night shift soon.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:57.390
The team needs urgent rebuilding.

00:03:57.390 --> 00:04:00.130
That’s why I summoned you.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.860
Can you do it, Sibylla Dominüra?

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:06.600
That’s why I came after all.

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:09.890
Let’s get moving!
We’re checking the helical motors!

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:12.890
Don’t forget to reload the ammo!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.900
Look here, Rimone,
what are you doing?

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:21.820
Stop dragging Aer down.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.650
If you’re not motivated,
why don’t you quit?

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:28.160
I’m here because
they told me to come.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.660
Listen, you!

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:32.910
That’s…

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.420
You must be the new arrival.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.750
Your name’s… Dominüra?

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.930
So you’re Rimone.

00:04:58.050 --> 00:04:59.720
Sibylla Rimone…

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:03.940
During your trainee days, your
talents were asserted to the fullest.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:07.400
Since training school,
you’ve rewritten record books…

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:13.450
…as the youngest achiever in written
and practical exams, the top sagitta.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:18.710
Afterwards, recognizing your skills,
the powers that be assigned you…

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:24.760
…the youngest sibylla, to Chor Tempest
as an exception among exceptions.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:27.580
Combat experience… zero.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:31.760
You mobilized without
permission the other day…

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:32.810
How…

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:35.810
Because I was interested.

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:42.480
You don’t need me to tell
you that your dossier is ideal.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.590
At least until Chor Tempest fell apart.

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:48.780
You’re feeling hesitant, aren’t you?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:52.830
After all, who ever thought
you’d turn into a sibylla like this?

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.450
What are you saying?

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:58.460
I’m the one who can save you.

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:02.830
Trust me, dear.

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:05.550
Just do as I tell you.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.970
Then you can
return to your past glory.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:13.470
Back to the peak
where prodigies belong.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:20.390
It seems Dominüra plans to rebuild
Chor Tempest with Rimone at its core.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:25.580
Well, chor matters are your domain.
I have no clue about them.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:26.990
No clue?

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.050
Just think.

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:32.990
What are those highly
emotional sibyllae thinking?

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:36.160
It’s far beyond the grasp of us adults.

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:41.390
We can’t even begin to understand
how the youngest sibylla feels…

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:44.210
How presumptuous would that be?

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.070
Guragief, let me say one thing.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:49.220
What?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:54.720
What we’re dealing with now is a war.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:58.270
Even children can sense that.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.280
Who is it?

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:37.220
I didn’t expect you to show up here.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:46.060
Um, if I said I wanted to dissolve
our pair, what would you think, Aer?

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.730
I wouldn’t mind.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:52.200
If that’s what you really want,
Rimone, I’m fine with it.

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:55.770
It’s not as though I…

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.320
Is that all?

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:03.710
If only these hands on
the flight stick could be removed…

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.290
It can’t be helped…

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.570
It can’t be helped.

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:11.550
Rimone, you can
go over there till I’m done.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.300
Hurry! Go over there!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:24.600
I’ve never made any
choices on my own till now.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:28.940
I’ve always done
whatever others told me to do.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.910
And the next thing I knew, I was here.

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:35.310
So I’d like you to decide for me, Aer.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:38.120
Does that mean you’d kill
someone if you were told to?

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.620
I don’t know…

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:45.620
I won’t tell you
what to do. Not anything.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:50.000
I’m here because
I chose not to make choices.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:54.170
If you’re scared of fighting,
you should quit being a sibylla.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:59.640
If you want to stay here,
you have to keep flying a Simoun.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:07.150
If you really have no reason to be
here, quitting’s the only choice.

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:22.740
Why?

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:33.900
Rimone, you’re wonderfully talented.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:37.180
I’m sure you can become
an amazing Simoun sibylla.

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:43.180
Rimone, match your partner!

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:47.940
Because there isn’t anyone
who can keep up with you.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.650
You’re still a child!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.400
Don’t butt in just because
you have a little talent!

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.110
I’m just…

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:15.630
Why have you stopped
flying Simouns, Sibylla Aurea?

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.150
Are you afraid?

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:20.680
That’s not it.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:24.340
It’s just that right now, I…

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:32.060
Sibylla Aurea…
what are we all here for?

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.070
You…

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.800
You should know the answer.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.070
Please tell me…

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:50.080
As I am now, I can’t possibly help you.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.590
Rimone!

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.440
After all that…

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:55.190
After all that,
nothing’s changed for me at all.

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:15.490
Scout their strength?

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:20.100
It seems there’s word of
significant military action in the north.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:22.470
In the north?
The Plumbum highlands?

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:27.970
Or rather, it’s a chance to see
Dominüra and Rimone’s compatibility.

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:31.480
They’re sending those
two along with Floe and Alty.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.480
Have those two paired up?

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:40.980
They say it was Dominüra’s decision.
I wonder what kind of person she is?

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:46.740
Wait, Rimone.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:49.240
This is where you’re sitting.

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:55.570
I’m the auriga?

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:58.640
Right. This is where you belong.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:12:59.830
But…

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:02.730
I know.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.150
I’m doing this for your own good.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:07.780
Despite that?

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:09.640
That’s precisely why.

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.980
Since that incident…

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:17.760
…you’ve been subconsciously holding
back your abilities. Release them.

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:22.560
Didn’t I tell you? No one
knows more about you than me.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.110
Trust me.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:28.130
If you do, everything will turn out fine.

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.450
She made Rimone the auriga.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.310
I guess she’s giving it some thought.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:09.950
Well? Are you starting to get the feel?

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:25.290
Arriving at target destination shortly.
Maintain contact as we start scouting.

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:26.170
Roger.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.690
So let’s hear it, Rimone.

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:47.850
Are you up to the job of auriga?
Or are you being a pushover again?

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:50.980
There’s to be
no talking during the operation.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:54.580
Also, never ask Rimone
questions like that.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.080
Yes, ma’am.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.090
It’s snowing.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.100
No wonder it’s so chilly.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:24.610
Right wing, no sign of aircraft.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.610
Likewise, no sign of aircraft ahead.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.260
Enemy at three o’clock!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.480
There’s a lot!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.170
Let’s go too, Rimone.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.000
Rimone!

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.010
Rimone!

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:40.890
Stop it, Rimone! A sudden
Silver Ri Majon is too risky!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.600
No, we can.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.900
It’s not possible! Just do as I say!

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:53.400
We can do it.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.910
It’s simple.

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:19.220
Your trainee days still haunt you?

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:29.940
Not good. All this snow…

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:31.940
This snowstorm!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:46.650
They’re late… They should’ve
been back a long time ago.

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:02.470
Oh! Who knew there were so many?

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.410
What do we do?

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:09.980
We can barely fly straight in this
snowstorm, let alone try a Ri Majon.

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:15.990
It’s hard enough for us…
but those two just paired up.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:20.530
Rimone, we’re retreating. There’s
no point if we can’t do a Ri Majon.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:22.240
Our mission is scouting.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:25.250
We’ll regroup and come back later!

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.150
Rimone, answer me!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:36.760
Rimone!

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:39.970
Aer.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.480
Why did you come?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.960
You were so late we came
to pick you up. Situation?

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.780
We’re about to retreat.

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.030
Rimone!

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:03.490
What should we do, Rimone?

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:05.420
I…

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:09.130
Rimone! Do as I say!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.800
Make up your own mind.

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:19.570
Or are you being a pushover again?

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:33.730
Rimone!

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:40.530
Silver Ri Majon.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.030
Rimone!

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:44.370
Aer, together?

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:46.870
Roger! Go for it!

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:51.370
It’s suicidal! In these conditions…
And it needs several Simouns!

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:53.370
Silver Ri Majon!

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.890
It won’t work! Disengage!

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:40.420
That’s right…
What I wanted to achieve…

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:47.600
…was a Ri Majon more
perfect than anyone else’s.

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:36.350
Did we do it?
Did we destroy those enemy tanks?

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:17.390
She’s a genius after all.

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:21.790
I was right about her all along.

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:47.830
<i>It is played by my wounds…
the song of prayer.</i>

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:52.060
<i>Let it ring out over
the grieving universe.</i>

00:22:52.060 --> 00:22:59.100
<i>Can we change tomorrow?
Don’t be afraid.</i>

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:07.100
<i>I want to let you know
how my heart’s overflowing.</i>

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:19.620
<i>“I want to get closer to you.”
“I want to feel your pulse.”</i>

00:23:19.620 --> 00:23:24.800
<i>I was too defiant,
and I took the long way around.</i>

00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:28.770
<i>The blue moon is swaying silently.</i>

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:32.810
<i>My true heart’s desire is you.</i>

00:23:32.810 --> 00:23:38.680
<i>I can’t reach you.
My tears of pain trickle down.</i>

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:44.220
<i>Soar away into the sky, song of prayer.</i>

00:23:44.220 --> 00:23:47.690
<i>Carrying my love that came too late.</i>

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:53.320
<i>What can I do to change tomorrow?</i>

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:59.590
<i>Just hold on to “now” the way it is…</i>

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.630
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:09.640
I’m Kaim, Sibylla Paraietta’s…

00:24:09.640 --> 00:24:11.730
Para-sama’s pair.

00:24:14.410 --> 00:24:16.280
Next time on Simoun…

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:19.970
<b>Wounds and Pain</b>

00:24:16.280 --> 00:24:17.890
Wounds and Pain.
